{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "main_6_level_main_06-10_beg",
  "groupId": "main_6",
  "stageId": "main_06-10",
  "title": "'Times Like These'",
  "storyCode": "6-11",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_06-10_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "65dd7748cd1e559a579b47ef8c0f3a036ed8827375d6efd1fa866278d1ca592b",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第四关（前）\nWaaahhh...\nI'm hungry!\nWhere's daddy? Where did he go?\nI want my daddy...! Daddy! Daddyyy!\nDaddy will come get me!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "GreyThroat",
      "text": "......!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "GreyThroat",
      "text": "A child?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "GreyThroat",
      "text": "Blaze-4, Amiya-1, come in. I'm in the slums. 4th Street, building number 10. There's a child survivor, Infected.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Child",
      "text": "Waaahhh...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "GreyThroat",
      "text": "...Hello.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Child",
      "text": "Wh- who are you?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Child",
      "text": "Are you a Lungmenite?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "GreyThroat",
      "text": "I will not hurt you. I don't speak Ursine well. I am not an enemy.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Child",
      "text": "What did you say?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "GreyThroat",
      "text": "Come with me. It is dangerous here.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Child",
      "text": "I can't... Uncle said to stay here.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "GreyThroat",
      "text": "But I will take you to find your dad.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Child",
      "text": "You can do that?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "GreyThroat",
      "text": "I can do that.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "GreyThroat",
      "text": "You, hiding behind me, come out.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "You're...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "You're not with them.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "You're... from Rhodes Island?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "GreyThroat",
      "text": "Child, stay back. Don't come closer.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "GreyThroat",
      "text": "Drop your weapon and come out with your hands up.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "What?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "You're not here to save us?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "Don't you Rhodes Islanders know what's hidden here?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "We worked hard to set up this ambush... If we can't lure them in, if we can't take them out, they'll kill all of us!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "GreyThroat",
      "text": "You're using children as bait. You deserve to be killed.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "You think this will end when we're dead?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "Even if they kill us, they won't let the children go. They won't let anyone go!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "If that's all it took, we'd gladly die to save the kids!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "We didn't even attack you!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "GreyThroat",
      "text": "Who's killing children...? The people in the black raincoats?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "You've seen them, you understand! They're slaughtering everyone!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "GreyThroat",
      "text": "That's no excuse. After I take you in, I will apply to have you protected.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "And we're supposed to just trust you? That crossbow of yours is a killing tool, what are you protecting?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "GreyThroat",
      "text": "For now, I'm protecting your lives.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "Save it. We'll deal with you, then reset our trap!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "We've already got the order to form up and retreat. If we die here, it would dishonor those comrades who died to save their children!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "GreyThroat",
      "text": "...Child, take cover!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "GreyThroat",
      "text": "Hm...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "GreyThroat",
      "text": "I'm still alive?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "You think you'd be better off dead?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "GreyThroat",
      "text": "Operator Blaze?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "text": "It's not like you dying would solve anything. Better keep on ticking.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "GreyThroat",
      "text": "What about... the Reunion men? And the children?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "text": "Operator GreyThroat, I got you all wrong. And I'm sorry.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "GreyThroat",
      "text": "The children!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "text": "I took care of the Reunion guys! I hid the kids! Just listen to me already!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "GreyThroat",
      "text": "No need... as long as the children are safe.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "text": "Can you not be obnoxious for like five minutes?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "GreyThroat",
      "text": "What did you get wrong about me?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "text": "I watched you stand up to fight for Infected kids. It was hella leng noi.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "GreyThroat",
      "text": "Your Lungmen dialect sucks.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "text": "Hey, that's off the top of my head! But really, I thought you were just some heartless uninfected girl, joining Rhodes Island to spy on us or whatever. I got you all wrong.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "GreyThroat",
      "text": "If I were a spy, this is how I'd get you to trust me. As long as you weren't stupid enough to let me bleed out...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "GreyThroat",
      "text": "You bandaged me?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "text": "I'm still an elite operator. It's my job.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "text": "Anyway, you're right.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "text": "But even if you were a spy, you still did the right thing. So I'll save this spy's life and then pack her off to Legal.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "GreyThroat",
      "text": "I could just run.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "text": "Let's not be stupid here. How are you gonna outrun me?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "text": "Trust doesn't mean letting your guard down. Trust means knowing what you'll do and what you won't.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "text": "If you do the right thing, I'll back you up. If you do the wrong thing, I'll correct it, or stop it, if I have to. That's trust.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "text": "Thanks, GreyThroat. You trusted me, and you corrected my wrong thoughts with your right actions.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "text": "And I'm sorry.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "GreyThroat",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "text": "But you really need to work on your people skills. They didn't want to be difficult, that was a show for survival.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "text": "If you screw up, you still need to go to Legal.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "GreyThroat",
      "text": "Whatever.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Well done!",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "Seems they're getting along better?",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "I think so... at least Blaze is trying. Leave it to her to drop her prejudices so quickly.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Rhodes Island's elite operators have more than just their incredible combat skills. Blaze is also gifted with a gregarious personality and savoir faire. As well as her own opinions.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "If you want to lead her, if you want her support, you'll have to gain her trust. And first, you have to learn how.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "I've fought alongside Blaze for a long time. And I think... I think you can too, Doctor.",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "I'm doing okay.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Amiya",
              "text": "But okay... isn't good enough, is it?",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Amiya",
              "text": "She puts up a carefree front, but Blaze has a complicated personality.",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Amiya",
              "text": "Give it time, keep your eyes open, and I know you can do it, Dr. {@nickname}.",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Amiya",
              "text": "But you need to put in more work!",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Amiya",
              "text": "Learning to trust each other isn't easy, but it needs to be done.",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Amiya",
              "text": "We need your power, Doctor, and you need to win over the operators to turn those tactics of yours into reality.",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Amiya",
              "text": "That's a lengthy process, but it's one you need to experience.",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "She has to cooperate.",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Amiya",
              "text": "Blaze is an elite operator who excels in assault operations. She doesn't have much to offer in the way of strategic thinking.",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Amiya",
              "text": "She really needs your support. Or you could think of it like she'll turn your strategies into reality on the battlefield. She's a professional.",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Amiya",
              "text": "I'd say she's already cooperating.",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Like, look where we are now...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Our operators follow our orders out of a sense of duty, not trust.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Real trust is built on understanding. The kind Blaze is working on with GreyThroat.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Oh...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Looks like we've got company. More Reunion.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Let's give Blaze a little more room to apologize. She still needs to stick her foot in her mouth a few more times.",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Then let's buy them some time!",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "She's the foot-in-mouth type, huh?",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Yep.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "She's a good conversationalist, but not so great at expressing her feelings.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "What's really going on here is her confronting her deep-seated prejudices more than just an apology to GreyThroat.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Normal folks' prejudices against the Infected aren't a one way street... we have our own issues with the uninfected.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "The enemy within is just as much an enemy as the enemy without.",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "We'll defeat them both.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "...We will.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Listen up.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Those Reunion guys were scared out of their wits.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Neither we nor the L. G. D. can put that kind of fear into someone. They were ready to go against everything they stood for.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "They met something else... But what was it out there that could do that to them?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "And... will we have to fight them too?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
